// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2750888458" "I've been given an important task by Arachnos, {VillainName}, and I have to come through. If you're prepared to see it through without asking any questions, we can work together and both wind up looking good. The first step is to invade a Longbow base. Think you can handle that?"
// AcceptString :
"P373894820" "Invade a Longbow base"
