// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1954504367" "I know you think all you got from McGowin's pockets was a bunch of junk. But you found what I was looking for. In this locket, here. Pretty picture, yes? That's McGowin's late wife. Killed by Arachnos agents in a minor scuffle in Paragon City. Disastrous PR. Anyway, she's the reason McGowin joined Longbow. It's no surprise he keeps his most precious possessions hidden behind her portrait. <br><br>What's in it? Well, You'll have to prove yourself worthy first. I need you to get to a certain cargo ship and eliminate every last agent on board. And don't ask any questions."
// AcceptString :
"P2818130713" "Eliminate agents on ship"
// SendOffString :
"P1035184623" "Remember: every agent."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2195030356" "Eliminate all agents on ship"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3891851609" "You've got a ship to hijack, haven't you?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P186161063" "Your footsteps echo on the deck plating. You'd better announce yourself, and quickly."

